 Haryana Victim Compensation Scheme-2020 No.S.O.24/C.A.2/1974/S.357A/2020- In exercise of powers conferred by Section 357-A of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 (Central Act 2 of 1974), the Governor of Haryana in co- ordination with the Central Government, hereby frames the following schemes for providing funds for the purpose of compensation to the victim or his/her dependents who have suffered loss or injury as a result of the crime and who require rehabilitation, namely:-
